@@title SQ-SB pillager spawners out, spawn boxes on pillager and witch structures, 2026-10-30
@@phase worldgen
@@date 2026-10-30
@@jars creativedelight creativeworldgen
@@prep B: difficulty=normal
@@text
@@text Creative Common 1.1.04 of 17:55 in `mods/` (`TemplateSpawnerFilter`, `StructureSpawnBoxes`, `ChunkGeneratorSpawnBoxesMixin`,
@@text CEConfig `[worldgen.systems] spawnBoxes`, `removeSpawners`); data `kubejs/generation_scripts/worldgen/spawn_boxes.json`.
@@text Full restart. Spawners: new chunks only; boxes: old chunks too. Writeup [structure_tuning.md](../structure_tuning.md) 3.32
@@text (ST-320 to ST-327). Group B (fresh normal world, difficulty Normal, `/gamerule doDaylightCycle false`, `/time set night`
@@text unless a row says day); one world for all rows. Spawns need a player 24-128 blocks away: stand at the box edge.
