## SQ-SB-06 | box evokers drop no totem
@group B
@commands `/locate structure towns_and_towers:pillager_outpost_badlands` (a fort); kill evokers that spawn there; `/locate structure minecraft:mansion`, kill a generated evoker
@pass fort evokers drop no Totem of Undying; the mansion's generated evoker does (ST-325)
@fails totem from a box evoker: `onSpecialSpawn` mark missing (`/data get entity @e[type=evoker,limit=1,sort=nearest] ForgeData`)
@from batches/r1101/w2_worldgen.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> locate structure towns_and_towers:pillager_outpost_badlands
waitlog nearest towns_and_towers:pillager_outpost_badlands is at|type "?towns_and_towers:pillager_outpost_badlands|towns_and_towers:pillager_outpost_badlands.*timed out 330
