## SQ-DM-01 | dandelions mature on Rich Soil and Fertile Soil, not on grass
@group D
@commands plant a dandelion on Rich Soil, one on Fertile Soil, one on grass; `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 300`; wait 1 min
@pass rich and fertile dandelions become Mature Dandelions, the grass one does not
@fails nothing: soil mixin not applied (boot log), or `[dandelion_maturing]` value 0
@jars creativedelight
@from batches/r1031/a1_world.qb passed
> setblock -10 -61 10 farmersdelight:rich_soil
> setblock -10 -60 10 minecraft:dandelion
> setblock -13 -61 10 immersive_weathering:mulch_block
> setblock -13 -60 10 minecraft:dandelion
> setblock -16 -60 10 minecraft:dandelion
> tp qa -13 -60 7
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 300
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block -10 -60 10 veggiesdelight:mature_dandelion
> execute if block -13 -60 10 veggiesdelight:mature_dandelion
> execute if block -16 -60 10 veggiesdelight:mature_dandelion
count Test passed == 2
count Test failed == 1

## SQ-DM-02 | richSoilTicks 0: a Rich Soil dandelion stays plain
@group D
@commands set `richSoilTicks = 0` in the toml, reload world; repeat SQ-DM-01 on Rich Soil
@pass Rich Soil dandelion stays plain
@fails config not read live
@jars creativedelight
@from batches/r1031/a2_variants.qb passed
> setblock -10 -61 14 farmersdelight:rich_soil
> setblock -10 -60 14 minecraft:dandelion
> tp qa -10 -60 11
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 300
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block -10 -60 14 minecraft:dandelion
